------- FILE bank3.asm LEVEL 1 PASS 2
      1  fffe					      processor	6502
      2  10000 ????				       seg	code
      3  10000 ????						; ==============================================================================
      4  10000 ????						; NEW ROM bank 3 - GAMEPLAY CODE (docs/agents/banks.md, Layout v3).
      5  10000 ????						; From the old ROM: the raft, the strip blasts, ClearPFColumn, BombMarkWalls (old bank1) and the cave
      6  10000 ????						; kernel's VBL PROLOGUE (old bank7). (Stage band + colour build stay with the extras walkers in bank 5:
      7  10000 ????						; B3StageBand `jsr`s PhaseBlink, and a subroutine call cannot cross banks.)
      8  10000 ????						; ==============================================================================
