    334  f8c6							;  StripBlastCheck is reached by label and floats. It now starts right after
    335  f8c6							;  the raft tramp twin; the $F9AC pin still bounds the sound-leaf block.)
    336  f8c6							; StripBlastCheck — Phase 4: bomb blast vs the D6 patch strips. Tail-jumped
    337  f8c6							; from BombMarkWalls .BMWDone through M1StripBlast (same bank, label `jmp`s
