    342  f8c6							; In: BMWScratch = strip left col pL in RIGHT-half space ($FF = none/sym,
    343  f8c6							; captured before the punch loop), CollisionEndX/CellX = blast window in
    344  f8c6							; LEFT-half space (bomb col mirrored at BMW entry), CollisionX = count.
