    685  fde3							; surface (line 132) - 7, so its BOTTOM row
    686  fde3							; sits exactly ON the surface. The live value is
    687  fde3							; plank's BOTTOM row (top+1) lands on the water
    688  fde3							; surface (132+off) — see the tide block below;
    689  fde3							; never hard-code the Y: the surface MOVES.
